6. NVIDIA TensorRT Edge-LLM                                      Apache-2.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
https://github.com/NVIDIA/TensorRT-Edge-LLM — Copyright NVIDIA CORPORATION &
AFFILIATES. The GPU slot pool of src/mjolnir/mjolnir/qwen4exp/ple_disk_cache.py
follows the design of its 0.12 PLE cache (`--ple-residency cached`: CLOCK slot
index, page-aligned read planner, parallel pread readers), and
tests/cli/test_qwen4exp_ple_disk_cache.py carries a sequential Python port of
its PleCache as the reference the slot index is checked against.

